B.xh=new A.Ba("About","Skills","Projects","Experience","Contact","Technical analyst focused on banking technologies, API integrations and process analysis.","I transform business needs into practical technical solutions across notification processes, system integrations, test scenarios and technical documentation.","View Projects","Download CV","Contact Me","About","An analytical technical analysis practice turning banking technology needs into clear implementation flows.","I have been working as a technical analyst in banking and technology for nearly 3 years. I focus on notification processes, API integrations, data analysis, test scenario design and process improvement. I work with tools such as Azure DevOps, MSSQL, Postman and Swagger to support technical requirement analysis, business rule documentation, regression testing, integration validation and production coordination.",B.D5,"Skills","A focused toolkit for technical analysis, integration and testing.","The skill set is organized around the workflows it supports: analysis, documentation, integration, testing, process improvement and reporting.","Projects","Technical analysis workstreams aligned with my CV experience.","These workstreams reflect my real focus across notification processes, API integrations and a personal brand web portfolio.","Contact Me","Experience","End-to-end experience across banking, e-commerce operations and project processes.","Contact","Let\u2019s talk about new ideas, flows, and product needs.","Reach me directly through LinkedIn, GitHub or e-mail.","E-mail","\xa9 2026 Emre Can Karacaa\u011fa\xe7l\u0131. All rights reserved.",B.Dy,B.DA)
